# Mission 1 through the game session (docs/missions.md; the Godot port's mission spec):
# MAP.210's bunker gate -> 214 -> 215 (the floor pad, the lift button) -> 217 and the last
# objective, then MISSION COMPLETE and mission 2's first map.
mission 1
expect map 210
expect left 3
use 0x07fcb          # the bunker gate: exit 214/0
expect map 214
use 0x02f4e          # exit 215/0
expect map 215
stand 0x032cb        # the floor pad: objective 1
expect left 2
use 0x02f8f          # the lift button: objective 2, the lifts rise
expect left 1
use 0x04130          # exit 217/15
expect map 217
use 0x0ba48          # objective 3: the counter runs out
expect left 0
wait 3
expect phase complete
wait 6.5
expect mission 2
expect map 220
expect phase playing
